        "h": "NECA's ULTRAmate Ghost Face, with Dead by Daylight extras",
        "p": "NECA's ULTRAmate Ghost Face includes several robes, among them a Dead by Daylight poncho, knives, a mock video-rental VHS tape, a red Dead by Daylight mask and a new <em>Scary Movie</em> mask. Pre-orders run through the NECA Store; no date has been announced.",
